{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/news/20261012/photo/bkn-20261012141316101-1012_00822_001_01p.jpg?20261012142133\"/><p>人員圍封現場調查。</p><p>葵涌有人墮樓亡。今午(12日)1時12分，石梨邨突然傳出砰然巨響，保安員外出查看，赫見有人昏迷倒臥石廣樓對開。救護員接報到場經檢驗證實事主當場身亡，人員圍封現場調查，正了解其身份及墮樓原因。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-12T06:42:23.228031+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":113,"images":1,"source":"東網 本地","fallback":"none"},"published_at":"2026-10-12T06:13:16+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-12T07:57:49.840347+00:00","content_updated_at":null,"content_hash":"d155e407320a974fa6c56d33740ad91fb4502accf6db3e06effaae93322e3327","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null}